<p>Hi <%= @user.name %>,</p>
<p>You are invited to choose your next posing date at <%= @venue.name %>.</p>
<%= render "venues/regular_schedule", venue: @venue %>
<p><%= link_to "Choose Your Posing Date", @booking_url %>. Sign in to your existing account, then choose an available future date.</p>
<p>You may cancel or reschedule with an explanation. After you finish posing, an organizer must invite you again before you can make another booking.</p>
